  "ruleText": "Env-A 1302.37 “Ozone season” means the period between March 1 and September 30, inclusive.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1300) #9803, eff 10-31-10; ss by #12584, eff 8-15-18 (formerly Env-A 1302.36)",
